You cannot include an install.packages statement in the code that you deploy, but if you install rgdal locally, and include library(rgdal) in the code you deploy, it will be installed for your application on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>.

sp only suggests rgdal, so we don't know if you plan to use the features that trigger it being required or not.

