Hi,

I have a important question about the server location to shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>.

We are a European Company with a new Data Protection law, and we want to use the shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> with personal data, but if the serve who storage the data are located out of Europe we need the consents of all people.

The question is:

> We can choose the location of shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> servers when we use that service?  (we would need the servers in Europe).

Best regards,
Carlos

