The Security and Compliance <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/security-and-compliance.html> documentation and GDPR statements <https://www.rstudio.com/about/rstudio-and-the-gdpr-what-you-need-to-know/> are probably what you are looking for.

Short answer is that the services is hosted in AWS us-east-1 region and it is not possible to choose the location of servers.

You might consider looking into one of our on-premise productions Connect <https://www.rstudio.com/products/connect/> or Shiny Server Pro <https://www.rstudio.com/products/shiny-server-pro/>.

